B.a4x=new A.B("Who may use Sportstures","Accounts are held by schools, not individuals. A school registers through an authorised member of staff, who may then invite coaches and administrators. Anyone may browse fixtures, results and tables without an account.")
B.a4A=new A.B("Your responsibilities","The registering school is responsible for the accuracy of what it publishes: team sheets, fixtures and results. Schools must hold the appropriate consent for any learner they list, and must keep their staff accounts current when people change roles.")
B.a3X=new A.B("Results and records","Either school in a fixture may post the result. Where entries disagree, both are flagged and neither counts towards a table until the schools settle it. Corrections remain on the record so that tables can be recalculated transparently.")
B.a3t=new A.B("Acceptable use","Sportstures may not be used to harass, abuse or expose any person, to publish anything misleading about a match, or to collect information about learners for any purpose beyond school sport. Accounts that do so are suspended.")
B.a4c=new A.B("Availability","We work to keep the platform available during fixtures and will give notice of planned maintenance where we can. We cannot guarantee uninterrupted service and are not liable for a fixture missed because of an outage.")
B.a5L=new A.B("Intellectual property","Schools keep ownership of their crests, team names and the content they upload, and grant Sportstures permission to display it on the platform. The platform itself, its design and its software remain ours.")
B.a5H=new A.B("Ending an account","A school may close its account at any time. Published results stay on the record, since removing them would distort the tables of every school they played; team sheets and contact details are removed.")
B.a3N=new A.B("Changes to these terms","We will give schools notice before material changes take effect. Continuing to use the platform after that date means accepting the revised terms.")
B.XD=s([B.a4x,B.a4A,B.a3X,B.a3t,B.a4c,B.a5L,B.a5H,B.a3N],t.Wy)
B.F5=new A.yO("/terms","Terms & Conditions","The agreement between Sportstures and the schools, staff and visitors who use it.",B.XD,0,"terms")
B.a3q=new A.B("What we collect","For schools: the school name, region, sports fielded, and contact details for the staff who run the account. For learners: name, team, age group and the statistics that come out of matches played. For visitors: basic usage data that tells us which pages are used.")
B.a4q=new A.B("What we publish","Team sheets, fixtures, results, tables and the statistics derived from them. We do not publish a learner's contact details, home address, date of birth, identity number or photograph without the school confirming consent.")
B.a4C=new A.B("Why we collect it","To run fixtures and produce the tables and rankings that follow from them. We do not sell personal information, and we do not use it to advertise to learners or their families.")
B.a4L=new A.B("Children","Most of the people represented on this platform are minors. Consent is handled by the school under its own parental consent arrangements, and a parent may ask the school to hide a learner from public listings while keeping them in the team internally.")
B.a5s=new A.B("Who can see what","Fixtures, results and tables are public. Team management, contact details and account settings are visible only to the staff of that school. Coaches can be given access to their own teams only.")
B.a3Z=new A.B("How long we keep it","Match records are kept for the history of the competition. Personal details of staff and learners are removed when a school closes its account or asks us to remove them.")
B.a3v=new A.B("Your rights","You may ask what we hold about you, ask for it to be corrected, or ask for it to be deleted. Requests about a learner should come through the school in the first instance. Contact us and we will respond.")
B.a45=new A.B("Security","Access is restricted to the school that owns the data. We review who can reach what, and we will tell affected schools promptly if personal information is ever exposed.")
B.Xm=s([B.a3q,B.a4q,B.a4C,B.a4L,B.a5s,B.a3Z,B.a3v,B.a45],t.Wy)
B.F7=new A.yO("/privacy","Privacy Policy","What we collect, why we collect it, and what we will never do with it. Most of the people on this platform are children, and that shapes every answer below.",B.Xm,1,"privacy")
B.a46=new A.B("Our commitment","This is a platform about school children. Everything on it is built on the assumption that what we publish could be seen by anyone, so we publish only what belongs in public: how teams performed, not who a child is or where to find them.")
B.a4l=new A.B("What schools must do","Hold parental consent for every learner listed. Keep staff accounts current and remove access when someone leaves. Make sure the adults given coach accounts are cleared to work with children under your own policies.")
B.a3T=new A.B("What we never publish","Contact details, home addresses, dates of birth, identity numbers, medical information, or anything that would let a stranger identify or locate a learner outside a fixture.")
B.a3O=new A.B("Conduct","Coaches, administrators and spectators using the platform are expected to behave as they would at the touchline. Abuse, harassment, discriminatory language and intimidation have no place here and cost an account its access.")
B.a5Q=new A.B("Reporting a concern","If something on the platform worries you - a listing that should not be public, a message that crossed a line, an account that does not look legitimate - report it. Anything involving the safety of a child is looked at the same day.")
B.a4p=new A.B("Fair play","Results are a shared record. Entering a score you know to be wrong, or arranging fixtures to inflate a ranking, undermines every school on the table. Repeated cases are removed from rankings and the schools involved are contacted.")
B.a3P=new A.B("Images and video","Where a school uploads photographs or video, it confirms it holds consent for every child shown. We remove media on request from the school or a parent, without asking for a reason.")
B.Z9=s([B.a46,B.a4l,B.a3T,B.a3O,B.a5Q,B.a4p,B.a3P],t.Wy)
B.F6=new A.yO("/safety","Safety & Guidelines","How we keep a platform about school children safe, and what we expect from the schools and adults using it.",B.Z9,2,"safety")
B.UY=s([B.F5,B.F7,B.F6],A.aw("x<yO>"))
