B.a52=new A.B("How do we register our school?","Use Register School in the top bar. You will need the school name, your region, the sports you field and a contact for the sports office. Registration is free.")
B.a5z=new A.B("Who should hold the account?","Usually the sports director or an administrator in the sports office. You can invite coaches afterwards and give them access to their own teams only.")
